-XoM3Ca5U5C4EIV8emVt4w&oe=6A7DCE2C"}, {"file_name": "2023-01-26_16-34-26.mkv_snapshot_01.18.466_1440.png", "id": "3465087683770757", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974780_3465087687104090_5745773893023703044_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XPtuUIvVtugQ7kNvwGHJo-l&_nc_oc=AdqUCoEvi2olOCUoHR7TLgYa14Q9cOF1g7x7bta586nFgY1cUlFmtxQ0xa74aMDFEpo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHO_J-pVqkWXkaesEEy_kIpp0jvGAS7ukOzD3yeqzmo0A&oe=6A7D9F20"}, {"file_name": "2023-01-26_16-01-54.mkv_snapshot_00.25.826_1440.png", "id": "495260649347486", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974891_495260652680819_1612014108408918328_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WkNyQnyXzF4Q7kNvwFDdIED&_nc_oc=AdrAkKAFWF1ob93hLa4EtSC6A2dfYykDFaBnR8z8IywSi7ddzWzTlJhJf8bK0GhnfUU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGnrEcnxz5y0HJ4M7Tl3X3vvsMNms2xLsfpmJdylybXpA&oe=6A7DC643"}, {"file_name": "2023-01-26_16-57-00.mkv_snapshot_01.20.540_1440.png", "id": "910860627004003", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974801_910860630337336_8867062962642311624_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=07-f-1oE_9kQ7kNvwEulqQi&_nc_oc=AdrNipFIy6xktTuTxdOLmqDTlkHx-sXVacyju9iqT0C3adY9jcK_QxQMYZ6W0mUz-eY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHudbN2O6tux4J_fA_gx5aBrE66jTQBkT4i8-YhLo40eg&oe=6A7DB7BF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Unification_release-trailer_thumbnail_quest.png", "id": "222585180139802", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003238_222585183473135_4209265122119070746_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pwk4wed3Pj8Q7kNvwHU7HvN&_nc_oc=AdocNZDmi1hLVu0Cj9EsyolQl4YMX0g_hd0FNkwpg10rlyNG7ebHMQMuktWNlow1fu8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHGvu2UhVA9NTLRCht4ZOdyXpDhEcnN4tB1BSk9WPQA8w&oe=6A7DAB65"}, "display_name": "Unification", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unification is a gravity-shifting VR parkour roguevania. Descend from the orbital factory into the layers of the black hole engine. Explore vibrant shifting architectures in a harmony of momentum and destruction... assuming you\u2019re able to overcome the traps and inhabitants in your path.\n\nFeatures:\n- Fluid and powerful physics-based movement: Feel momentum and the wind rushing past while leaping into chasms, vaulting over ledges, weaving around traps, and shifting gravity at will.\n- Kinetic tools propelling you forward: Swing above traps with a grappling hook, or glide past with a parachute. Go in guns blazing with a shotgun, or slice with a katana. Forge a new path with a jackhammer, or warp through with a teleporter.\n- Procedural destructible biomes filled with traps and enemies: Navigate through voxel cave obstacle courses with branching paths that test your reactions, knowledge, and control. Feel free to explore the depths and get lost. The handheld mini-map and conveniently placed teleporters make it easy to quickly get back on track.\n- Dreamlike upgrades: Push the limits of physics and imagination during the journey to the core with fundamental changes to the game mechanics\n- Carefully crafted controls and haptics: Each action is positioned on the controllers to allow effortless simultaneous usage of all movement and tool capabilities, inducing a flow state of control.", "short_description": "Unification is a gravity-shifting VR parkour roguevania. Descend from the orbital factory into the layers of the black hole engine. Explore vibrant shifting architectures in a harmony of momentum and destruction... assuming you\u2019re able to overcome the traps and inhabitants in your path."}]}, "developer_name": "Troy Spencer", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gist.github.com/troyspencer/7c0c9a0f5b23daf767866b9416a145fd", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CrushPoint Games"